---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import ClosingPhotos from "../../components/ClosingPhotos.astro";
import { getGoogleRating } from "../../lib/google";
import { TEAM } from "../../lib/site";
const g = await getGoogleRating();
const z = TEAM.zillow;
const jsonld = [];
---
<Base title={"Client Reviews | Nazar Orishchin, Real Estate Agent"} description={`Google reviews from buyers, sellers and investors who worked with Nazar Orishchin of RE/MAX Results. ${g.rating.toFixed(1)} average across ${g.count} reviews.`} lang="en" active="/reviews/" jsonld={jsonld}>
<div class="wrap page-hero stack lg">
<p class="label">Reviews</p><h1>In my clients' own words.</h1>
<p class="lead">These are Google reviews, copied as written. Nothing edited, nothing invented.</p>
<p class="soft">Showing 8 of my {g.count} Google reviews, picked to cover buyers, sellers and investors.</p>
</div>
<section class="rule"><div class="wrap section tight stats">
<div class="stat"><b>{g.rating.toFixed(1)}</b><span>Average Google rating{g.url && <> · <a href={g.url}>see on Google</a></>}</span></div>
<div class="stat"><b>{g.count}</b><span>Google reviews across two office profiles, as of {g.checked}</span></div>
<div class="stat"><b>{z.reviews}</b><span>Team Steady reviews on <a href={z.url}>Zillow</a>, {z.rating.toFixed(1)} average</span></div>
<div class="stat"><b>100+</b><span>Transactions closed since 2022</span></div>
</div></section>
<section class="rule"><div class="wrap section tight"><ClosingPhotos photos={[2, 3, 4, 5, 1]} /></div></section>
<section class="rule"><div class="wrap section"><div class="masonry"><figure class="quote long"><div class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div><blockquote><p>Working with Nazar was the best decision we made during our home buying process. He is a true professional who knows the market, is very responsive, honest, and works hard behind the scenes to help you purchase your dream home. He was able to get our offer accepted within 2 days of the home going on market AND drop 15k from the asking price. HE is the guy you need in your corner! The home buying process was smooth and stress-free. We cannot recommend him enough!</p></blockquote><figcaption><b>Alena Golovchuk</b> · Google review</figcaption></figure><figure class="quote long"><div class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div><blockquote><p>Buying our first home felt overwhelming, and We were honestly very nervous about the whole process. From day one, Nazar made everything feel simple, organized, and stress-free. He patiently answered every question, explained every step, and made sure we always knew what to expect. His support gave us so much confidence throughout the entire journey. What impressed us the most was that his help didn’t stop after closing. Even after the deal was completed, he continued to check in, answer our questions, and guide us through the next steps. That level of care is something we truly appreciate and will never forget. We are incredibly grateful for everything Nazar did for us and couldn’t have asked for a better realtor for our first home. We highly recommend him to anyone looking for a knowledgeable, professional, and genuinely caring real estate agent. Thank you, Nazar, for making such an important milestone such a wonderful experience!</p></blockquote><figcaption><b>Pavlo Fursyak</b> · Google review</figcaption></figure><figure class="quote long"><div class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div><blockquote><p>Nazar went above and beyond for my husband and I, from start to finish, helping us balance selling and buying at the same time. He is creative, knowledgeable and personable. He helped us find the most house for our money and was even personally generous to us in a way he did not have to be when the seller really dropped the ball in a big way. We can’t say enough good things about Nazar.</p></blockquote><figcaption><b>Heather Sinz</b> · Google review</figcaption></figure><figure class="quote long"><div class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div><blockquote><p>I had a fantastic experience working with Nazar. From start to finish, he was on top of every detail—communicative, proactive, and always a step ahead. He helped me secure a great purchase price and guided us through a competitive offer situation to ultimately win the deal.</p><p>What stood out most was his problem-solving mindset. When unexpected issues came up (as they always do in real estate), he never got rattled—he calmly found solutions and kept everything moving forward. He&#x27;s extremely easy to work with and made the entire process smooth and efficient.</p><p>If you&#x27;re looking for a knowledgeable, steady, and responsive agent who knows how to get deals done, I&#x27;d highly recommend working with him.</p></blockquote><figcaption><b>jarred knapp</b> · Google review</figcaption></figure><figure class="quote long"><div class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div><blockquote><p>Working with Nazar was awesome. I could clearly tell that he cared about about getting us the best deal possible during the whole process of buying a home. He responded quickly, explained details clearly and made the whole process of finding the right home and negotiating a good price easy. Great experience!</p></blockquote><figcaption><b>Pavlo Kaploukhyi</b> · Google review</figcaption></figure><figure class="quote long"><div class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div><blockquote><p>Lots of good things to say about Nazar. Any real estate purchases I make, I’m ALWAYS going with Nazar. If you want THE DEAL, this is a guy you WANT to keep in your phone book... on speed dial. Great personality, honest with me, gave me all my options for my future real estate investments. Recommended him to anyone 100/10</p></blockquote><figcaption><b>Sergey Timoshenko</b> · Google review</figcaption></figure><figure class="quote long"><div class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div><blockquote><p>From the beginning I felt very comfortable with him as he really listened to what I was looking for in a new home. He had an endless amount of patience as I asked him a million questions. I didn&#x27;t have to wait very long for him to get back to me if I had to leave a message as he always got back to me in a timely fashion. And when I was ready to give up after being repeatedly outbid, he found me the perfect place for me and when I found out I got it, he made sure the closing went very smoothly. And then he brought me a nice bottle of wine to my housewarming party! I would definitely recommend Nazar and should I ever decide to move again, I&#x27;ll use his services again.</p></blockquote><figcaption><b>Sam Jones</b> · Google review</figcaption></figure><figure class="quote long"><div class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div><blockquote><p>Nazar is top notch! Very knowledgable on the process and market. I&#x27;d recommend him to any of my friends.</p></blockquote><figcaption><b>Josh Little</b> · Google review</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>
<section class="band"><div class="wrap section tight band-grid">
<div class="stack"><p class="label">Next step</p><h2>Want to be the next review?</h2><p class="soft">Tell me what you're trying to do and I'll tell you how I'd approach it.</p></div>
<div class="stack" style="align-items:flex-start"><a class="btn primary" href="/book/">Book a 15-min call</a>
<a class="arrow light" href="mailto:Nazar@ts-re.com">Or email Nazar@ts-re.com</a></div>
</div></section>
</Base>
